WEBVTT

01:28.105 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.825 --> 01:39.505
Do you know what you're about to face?

01:40.625 --> 01:42.225
It's Du Tingxin.

01:42.745 --> 01:44.745
She's a real mad dog!

01:54.065 --> 01:55.385
Amitabha.

01:57.625 --> 01:58.625
Du Tingxin's men are here.

01:59.945 --> 02:00.865
Thank you.

02:08.864 --> 02:10.105
Cangcang,

02:10.625 --> 02:12.705
about Princess Ying
and the Empress Dowager,

02:12.785 --> 02:15.625
even I don't fully know
how they really died.

02:17.225 --> 02:18.665
I understand.

02:23.785 --> 02:24.945
Thank you, Father.

02:26.785 --> 02:29.105
I remember, when you were little,

02:30.945 --> 02:33.025
you'd always pester me to braid your hair.

02:35.065 --> 02:37.545
But I was never any good at it.

02:40.825 --> 02:42.345
Later on,

02:42.425 --> 02:47.025
you stopped caring
about those girlish things.

02:52.705 --> 02:55.345
I don't know if that's just your nature

03:00.985 --> 03:05.105
or if I didn't do well enough.

03:07.625 --> 03:09.825
Father, what's wrong?

03:14.185 --> 03:15.825
Hurry! Come on. Hurry!

03:16.545 --> 03:17.585
Quick!

03:26.745 --> 03:29.625
FAYUN TEMPLE

03:32.865 --> 03:34.025
THE UNPERTURBED PRESENCE

03:49.265 --> 03:50.545
‎SANSHENG HALL

03:59.145 --> 04:01.385
SANSHENG HALL

04:36.625 --> 04:37.945
Preceptor Du.

04:38.905 --> 04:40.265
It's been a long time.

05:07.625 --> 05:08.825
Grand Tutor Ling,

05:10.145 --> 05:12.265
so you really are still alive.

05:17.585 --> 05:21.825
Did you think that getting
the Empress out of the palace

05:22.505 --> 05:24.745
would keep her safe?

05:27.425 --> 05:31.425
Right now, she's quite safe.

05:33.385 --> 05:34.905
As expected of you.

05:40.425 --> 05:43.385
This plum wine was brewed last autumn.

05:44.345 --> 05:48.585
Spring is when it tastes best.

05:51.665 --> 05:55.825
I'm afraid I don't deserve your wine.

05:58.625 --> 06:00.425
Now that Xiao Huan is dead,

06:03.225 --> 06:05.945
I can keep the Empress alive.

06:12.825 --> 06:14.065
What do you want?

06:16.385 --> 06:18.385
I only ask you to write a letter,

06:18.905 --> 06:21.825
ordering General Ling Jueding
to hand over his command.

06:25.705 --> 06:30.585
To threaten a father with his son's
and daughter's lives like this…

06:32.665 --> 06:36.545
You're asking for a bit too much.

06:39.465 --> 06:41.385
The mighty Grand Tutor Ling,

06:42.385 --> 06:46.025
now trapped in this shabby temple.

06:47.065 --> 06:48.825
You should be grateful.

06:49.585 --> 06:51.225
You should be glad

06:52.185 --> 06:54.665
you still have a chance
to bargain with me.

06:58.025 --> 07:02.745
It seems I still underestimated you.

07:03.345 --> 07:06.105
The day you sent me
that blood-written letter,

07:06.625 --> 07:11.025
you should have known
this moment would come.

07:14.505 --> 07:16.905
You've already driven
Xiao Huan to his death.

07:18.065 --> 07:20.185
What more do you want?

07:22.305 --> 07:24.105
Have you forgotten

07:25.705 --> 07:28.465
I'm of the Xiao bloodline too?

07:46.025 --> 07:49.305
Grand Tutor, have you decided?

08:02.505 --> 08:05.745
It's a deal, but I need
to see some sincerity.

08:20.905 --> 08:23.505
Please drink this cup of poisoned wine,

08:24.305 --> 08:27.225
so I can feel at ease.

08:42.264 --> 08:43.664
Good!

08:43.745 --> 08:46.705
It's always easy
doing business with a smart man.

08:47.625 --> 08:51.745
So, Grand Tutor,
shall we start drafting the letter now?

08:54.665 --> 08:57.705
You still don't understand me at all.

08:59.105 --> 09:01.305
My life is mine to command.

09:03.785 --> 09:08.505
So, the advantage isn't yours alone.

09:12.625 --> 09:17.225
I've served in office for decades,

09:18.105 --> 09:19.825
and I've never bowed to threats.

09:25.985 --> 09:28.225
These prayer beads bear poison.

09:29.545 --> 09:32.025
I prepared it for myself long ago.

09:32.865 --> 09:34.785
To use it now is as good a time as any.

09:39.185 --> 09:41.345
Why don't you take a guess
and place a bet?

09:42.065 --> 09:44.185
Will your poison take effect first,

09:46.705 --> 09:49.545
or will mine?

09:53.305 --> 09:54.465
Fine.

09:55.865 --> 09:57.985
So, you really are set on dying.

10:01.345 --> 10:06.425
My fate was always bound to end like this.

10:07.425 --> 10:12.065
If I can't seize the Eastern Palace,
then wherever I am,

10:13.505 --> 10:15.345
I'll end in total defeat.

10:15.425 --> 10:18.305
This is the end I chose for myself.

10:19.105 --> 10:22.025
It's just a pity, Preceptor Du,

10:23.105 --> 10:25.625
that I won't live to see…

10:27.265 --> 10:28.945
how you end.

10:47.385 --> 10:50.785
You've gotten the end you asked for,
so may you rest in peace.

10:53.825 --> 10:57.145
I will be sure to reunite you

10:58.425 --> 11:00.745
with your daughter soon.

11:01.785 --> 11:07.025
Do you really think
you'll get what you want?

11:08.705 --> 11:10.105
Do you think

11:10.945 --> 11:16.025
the people you want dead
will die that easily?

12:04.865 --> 12:06.625
-Zhong Lin…
-Cangcang.

12:07.145 --> 12:08.265
You're awake.

12:10.665 --> 12:12.305
Where are we?

12:14.745 --> 12:15.825
Father…

12:17.305 --> 12:18.425
Where's my father?

12:21.985 --> 12:23.145
Where's my father?

12:28.305 --> 12:29.145
-Stop the carriage!
-Cangcang…

12:29.825 --> 12:31.225
Stop the carriage, now!

12:50.945 --> 12:54.185
SANSHENG HALL

12:55.305 --> 12:56.945
-Father!
-Cangcang!

12:57.545 --> 13:00.025
Father! I have to go back and save him!

13:00.105 --> 13:02.865
-Cangcang! Cangcang…
-I have to go back for him!

13:39.585 --> 13:40.665
Father.

13:43.665 --> 13:44.865
Cangcang…

13:50.025 --> 13:51.105
Cangcang…

13:52.545 --> 13:54.225
Father!

13:56.465 --> 13:58.385
Father!

13:58.465 --> 13:59.545
Cangcang…

14:01.025 --> 14:02.945
-Regarding roasted pear,
-Don't leave me!

14:03.025 --> 14:03.865
only Golden Leaf pears

14:03.945 --> 14:06.265
-from Shuiquan Village are the very best.
-Don't leave me!

14:07.385 --> 14:09.225
They're full of juice.

14:09.305 --> 14:12.905
And with your favorite
pear blossom honey on top,

14:13.865 --> 14:16.545
you used to love it so much!

14:17.065 --> 14:19.305
I love your roasted pears most.

14:22.545 --> 14:26.625
All I wish for you is peace and joy.

14:29.105 --> 14:30.825
May the deities and Buddha

14:32.065 --> 14:33.705
protect you for me.

14:34.785 --> 14:36.465
Father!

15:05.865 --> 15:09.785
Everything Grand Tutor Ling
did today was to keep you safe.

15:13.945 --> 15:15.305
Let's go.

15:58.465 --> 15:59.545
Father…

16:54.545 --> 16:57.385
WUYING HALL

18:03.985 --> 18:05.225
Madam,

18:05.305 --> 18:07.545
we found many bloodstains
along the Qining River bank,

18:07.625 --> 18:09.825
along with shredded pieces
of His Majesty's robes.

18:10.345 --> 18:12.505
I'm afraid His Majesty is dead.

18:23.705 --> 18:28.625
There's no going back now…

18:41.625 --> 18:43.665
DRAGON-PHOENIX BLESSINGS

18:43.745 --> 18:45.345
Word from the palace says

18:45.865 --> 18:47.225
His Majesty truly is dead.

18:47.305 --> 18:49.705
Impossible. I believe in him.

18:49.785 --> 18:52.785
If he's alive,
he would've come for you long ago.

18:52.865 --> 18:55.305
He knows all about
Fenglai Pavilion's shadow guards.

18:56.465 --> 18:58.385
It's been so long,
and he still hasn't shown up.

19:00.305 --> 19:01.945
These past few days, I've kept thinking.

19:02.465 --> 19:03.625
From the very start,

19:04.145 --> 19:06.065
he told me to leave
with the Imperial Seal.

19:06.145 --> 19:08.225
It means he'd sensed
the upheaval in the palace.

19:09.505 --> 19:12.785
That's exactly why I can't let him down.

19:12.865 --> 19:14.265
Not only must I guard the seal,

19:14.345 --> 19:16.465
but I also have to do
everything I can for him.

19:16.985 --> 19:18.265
What are you going to do?

19:20.945 --> 19:22.225
It's time

19:22.305 --> 19:25.905
to gather up my father's forces
in the palace and the Capital.

19:27.065 --> 19:28.145
All right.

19:28.705 --> 19:31.025
Then I'll hurry back to the palace
and get Xiao Qianqing to help us.

19:33.425 --> 19:35.705
You must be careful in everything.
Don't you dare act on impulse.

19:36.385 --> 19:39.145
Those people are probably
scouring the city for you.

19:40.585 --> 19:41.465
You should be careful too.

19:53.105 --> 19:54.785
A realm can't go a day without a ruler.

19:54.865 --> 19:55.745
PURE AND SPOTLESS

19:55.825 --> 19:57.705
With His Majesty's life
hanging by a thread,

19:57.785 --> 20:00.105
we petition Your Highness,

20:00.705 --> 20:03.265
for the sake of the countless people
of Great Qi,

20:03.345 --> 20:04.785
to take the reins!

20:04.865 --> 20:08.345
We all support Your Highness
ascending the throne!

20:10.785 --> 20:14.225
I understand where your hearts lie.

20:16.465 --> 20:17.305
You may withdraw for now.

20:19.465 --> 20:21.225
-Your Highness…
-Dismissed!

20:23.385 --> 20:24.465
Understood.

20:53.865 --> 20:56.265
Are you really going
to become a traitor and usurper?

20:57.745 --> 20:58.985
Do you truly want that throne?

21:02.425 --> 21:03.625
So, even you see me that way?

21:04.265 --> 21:05.425
Xiao Qianqing,

21:07.585 --> 21:09.985
you must not ignore right and wrong.

21:10.065 --> 21:12.625
If you really sit on that throne,
how will the world see you?

21:12.705 --> 21:14.825
You'll be the usurper who killed
the Emperor for the crown!

21:41.905 --> 21:43.105
Are you really going to usurp the throne?

21:47.385 --> 21:48.985
Have you thought at all

21:52.705 --> 21:54.265
about Xiao Huan?

21:55.345 --> 21:56.545
Or about Cangcang?

21:57.905 --> 21:59.545
He is dead.

22:02.105 --> 22:03.465
But rest assured,

22:04.265 --> 22:05.945
I won't harm Ling Cangcang.

22:06.945 --> 22:10.185
If we can find her,
I won't have her buried with him.

22:11.745 --> 22:13.545
I'll name her Empress of the Late Emperor

22:14.185 --> 22:17.505
and move her to a separate residence
to live in honor.

22:18.865 --> 22:20.785
Then I should thank you, shouldn't I?

22:30.705 --> 22:31.785
Zhong Lin,

22:35.945 --> 22:38.225
if you stay by my side,

22:39.265 --> 22:42.345
the two of us won't be
any different from before.

22:44.985 --> 22:46.265
So…

22:48.665 --> 22:51.665
you plan to lock me in one courtyard

22:53.505 --> 22:55.145
after another?

22:55.905 --> 22:59.425
I just hope
we don't stand on opposite sides.

23:02.785 --> 23:04.585
Not stand on opposite sides?

23:06.745 --> 23:09.225
You're the one
who's been walking away, not me!

23:10.425 --> 23:11.825
To be this emperor,

23:11.905 --> 23:13.905
you'd really be a coward
who lies to himself?

23:14.745 --> 23:16.905
What is it you really care about?

23:22.945 --> 23:24.825
What is it I really care about?

23:26.825 --> 23:30.705
What is it… I really care about?

23:33.865 --> 23:35.425
My imperial brother

23:37.025 --> 23:38.945
died right in front of me,
beyond all saving.

23:39.545 --> 23:41.465
Now there's nothing left
for me to care about!

23:42.065 --> 23:43.105
I only have…

24:05.185 --> 24:06.225
Zhong Lin…

24:06.905 --> 24:07.745
Let go of me!

24:08.345 --> 24:09.425
Let go!

24:10.625 --> 24:11.785
Zhong Lin…

24:14.785 --> 24:18.865
You've already done
enough for Ling Cangcang.

24:19.945 --> 24:22.145
All you need now is to stay by my side,

24:23.665 --> 24:25.905
just like before.

24:42.425 --> 24:43.305
I was wrong…

24:45.665 --> 24:48.305
You've made it painfully clear…

24:51.545 --> 24:53.385
that I misjudged you.

25:12.865 --> 25:15.225
I remember you once told me

25:16.265 --> 25:20.225
that ever since you were little,
you've always feared the sound of bells.

25:22.185 --> 25:24.985
You're afraid of that heart-ripping pain.

25:26.345 --> 25:28.105
You like the sound of running water.

25:28.905 --> 25:31.225
I made this for you myself.

25:35.745 --> 25:39.465
Its chime is clear as water, soft as rain.

25:41.625 --> 25:45.105
When you wear it,
you won't be afraid anymore.

26:06.745 --> 26:09.665
So, you're really giving up
on Xiao Huan and Cangcang?

26:30.345 --> 26:31.185
In that case…

26:41.145 --> 26:43.785
the Xiao Qianqing I once loved is dead.

26:46.025 --> 26:47.825
From this day on,

26:49.025 --> 26:50.625
between the two of us,

26:52.305 --> 26:54.305
all ties are cut!

27:45.745 --> 27:48.065
Minister of Rites Liu Mingzhuo
is advanced in years.

27:48.145 --> 27:49.625
He petitions to resign.

27:50.585 --> 27:51.985
Approved.

27:52.065 --> 27:55.065
Vice Minister of Revenue
Liu Cheng requests to retire.

27:55.985 --> 27:57.065
Approved.

27:57.145 --> 28:00.745
Director Chen Ling
of Personnel claims illness

28:00.825 --> 28:02.145
and voluntarily resigns.

28:02.225 --> 28:03.385
Approved.

28:05.385 --> 28:08.185
Your Highness, since you are Regent,

28:08.265 --> 28:11.865
you should handle all affairs personally.

28:11.945 --> 28:17.345
How can the memorials
be left to the Imperial Preceptor?

28:23.305 --> 28:25.865
I never wanted to be
Regent in the first place.

28:25.945 --> 28:28.985
Li Chengtian, if you can't stand me,

28:29.065 --> 28:31.145
you can impeach me all you like.

28:32.865 --> 28:34.025
You…

28:36.625 --> 28:39.625
Preceptor Du,
you ought to avoid suspicion.

28:40.265 --> 28:43.545
Otherwise, if this spreads,

28:43.625 --> 28:48.985
everyone will think
you are the one truly acting as Regent.

28:51.145 --> 28:52.545
I'm only sharing the burdens of the realm.

28:56.905 --> 29:00.465
Mr. Li, are you suspicious of me,

29:01.465 --> 29:05.345
or are you actually
coveting the Regent's power?

29:05.945 --> 29:08.585
What do you mean by that?

29:09.585 --> 29:14.385
I thought you still remembered
His Majesty's kindness

29:14.905 --> 29:16.825
and would at least show some restraint.

29:16.905 --> 29:17.945
But…

29:18.705 --> 29:20.905
Mr. Li, you truly wronged me.

29:21.425 --> 29:23.865
My heart is set only on Great Qi.

29:27.825 --> 29:30.505
Your Highness, in my view,

29:31.105 --> 29:34.545
Mr. Li is already advanced in age,
yet still toiling in court day after day.

29:34.625 --> 29:35.905
It is far too hard on him.

29:41.465 --> 29:43.665
Mr. Li, why not follow the others,

29:43.745 --> 29:45.585
resign and return to your family?

29:45.665 --> 29:47.945
-Wouldn't that be wonderful?
-Approved.

29:48.025 --> 29:49.025
Approved.

29:51.345 --> 29:55.505
No ambition,
unfit for great responsibility!

29:56.625 --> 29:57.825
MEMORIAL: REGARDING THE CASE…

30:10.905 --> 30:13.065
Who are you putting on this act for?

30:14.465 --> 30:16.785
What are you talking about?

30:16.865 --> 30:18.505
I don't understand a word.

30:21.785 --> 30:26.265
I hear you're still searching
the Qining River for Xiao Huan.

30:36.505 --> 30:40.185
Do you think he's really dead?

30:43.065 --> 30:45.425
Whether he's alive or dead,

30:46.105 --> 30:48.265
there's no turning back for us now.

30:59.185 --> 31:04.185
CHANGHE GATE

31:11.265 --> 31:12.305
-Sir.
-Sir.

31:13.025 --> 31:14.145
Sir,

31:14.225 --> 31:17.185
how did the Prince of Yuzhang
handle those resignation memorials?

31:17.945 --> 31:19.585
He approved them all.

31:19.665 --> 31:22.065
What is he trying to do?
He's going to ruin the realm.

31:22.145 --> 31:24.705
-What are we to do?
-Go back and tell the Old Madam

31:25.465 --> 31:28.385
to gather all the family
and leave the Capital at once.

31:28.465 --> 31:30.385
Sir, what about you?

31:30.465 --> 31:33.465
There's one last thing I must do.

31:33.985 --> 31:36.185
Once it's done, I'll catch up with you.

31:38.425 --> 31:39.505
-Understood.
-Yes, Sir.

31:46.985 --> 31:49.505
With His Majesty's fate uncertain,

31:50.025 --> 31:53.545
the court has fallen into chaos.

31:55.065 --> 31:57.985
The Prince of Yuzhang serves as Regent,
yet ignores state affairs.

31:58.985 --> 32:02.705
The Imperial Preceptor beside him
harbors wolfish ambition.

32:03.585 --> 32:05.265
Now in this court,

32:05.345 --> 32:08.785
those above cannot reach the imperial ear,

32:08.865 --> 32:12.425
and those below
cannot aid the common folk.

32:13.865 --> 32:15.705
Villains hold sway,

32:16.585 --> 32:21.705
a disgrace to Great Qi!

32:23.705 --> 32:25.945
If this goes on,

32:27.145 --> 32:30.705
the officials' hearts will scatter,

32:32.185 --> 32:38.025
and Heaven itself will show ill omen!

32:38.105 --> 32:41.145
QI

32:51.425 --> 32:55.585
Why don't we just throw
Li Chengtian into prison?

32:55.665 --> 32:57.945
Let's see how tough
this old bone really is.

32:59.785 --> 33:01.465
If I do that now,

33:01.545 --> 33:04.105
I'd only grant him
the name of a loyal minister.

33:05.585 --> 33:08.585
By now, every courtier
who can be threatened or bought

33:08.665 --> 33:10.345
is already under my command.

33:11.105 --> 33:12.385
Those who still refuse to yield

33:12.905 --> 33:15.745
also serve my purposes,
thanks to Lingbi Sect's Heartbane.

33:18.785 --> 33:21.505
Only a few stubborn old bones are left.

33:22.745 --> 33:26.105
They are a deadly hidden threat.

33:28.905 --> 33:32.465
Why not ask the Saintess to use
the Heartbane on him as well?

33:32.545 --> 33:36.145
That pack of vermin is foul and stubborn,
utterly unafraid of death!

33:36.865 --> 33:38.865
Even if I poison him,

33:39.385 --> 33:41.305
he'll most likely kill himself
to prove his loyalty.

33:52.985 --> 33:57.225
As for Li Chengtian, if he must die,

33:57.945 --> 34:01.745
I'll see that his death serves my ends.

34:06.825 --> 34:08.865
MERCIFUL SALVATION

34:18.304 --> 34:19.744
On guard!

34:44.705 --> 34:46.905
-Mr. Li!
-Mr. Li!

34:47.425 --> 34:49.264
-Mr. Li!
-Mr. Li!

34:50.585 --> 34:51.865
Mr. Li!

34:54.784 --> 34:55.625
Mr. Li!

34:58.705 --> 35:03.265
ONE WITH HEAVEN AND EARTH

35:09.745 --> 35:12.225
We respectfully greet the Saintess!

35:18.425 --> 35:19.545
Reporting to the Saintess,

35:19.625 --> 35:22.465
several of our branches
have been destroyed recently.

35:22.985 --> 35:24.025
They say…

35:24.545 --> 35:25.985
They say…

35:26.665 --> 35:28.185
Say what?

35:28.265 --> 35:30.745
They say the Ghost King has appeared,
and heaven and earth are as one.

35:31.265 --> 35:34.585
And the Ghost King even beat us to it,
completing the Nanrong Palace mission

35:34.665 --> 35:36.065
and killing Li Chengtian.

35:37.225 --> 35:38.665
How could a new Ghost King appear?

35:38.745 --> 35:41.305
Does he have the Moon-Eclipse on him?

35:42.345 --> 35:43.425
Yes.

35:43.505 --> 35:44.625
All those slain by him

35:45.345 --> 35:46.185
bear ghost markings.

35:47.385 --> 35:49.985
Only one who holds
the Moon-Eclipse can do this.

35:59.545 --> 36:01.145
The Ghost King's return

36:01.785 --> 36:04.025
is the glory of Lingbi Sect!

36:08.465 --> 36:10.105
SEVEN DAYS EARLIER

36:24.545 --> 36:27.105
Now the Saintess
is using Du Tingxin's hand

36:27.185 --> 36:29.745
to endanger the whole court,
even all of Great Qi.

36:29.825 --> 36:31.865
I've thought it through carefully.

36:32.385 --> 36:34.505
I stand in the light,
and the Saintess hides in the dark.

36:34.585 --> 36:36.985
If we are to save everyone's lives,

36:37.065 --> 36:39.225
we must stage my death.

36:39.305 --> 36:40.425
Your Majesty,

36:40.505 --> 36:43.025
your body is already spent.

36:43.105 --> 36:44.665
You can't take much more.

36:44.745 --> 36:46.625
How can you possibly stand against them?

36:50.105 --> 36:52.825
The Moon-Eclipse is the Ghost King's token

36:52.905 --> 36:55.105
because it is both medicine and poison.

36:55.625 --> 36:57.305
It can heal wounds and save lives

36:57.385 --> 36:59.585
and even strengthen one's inner power.

37:00.505 --> 37:03.985
But once it's used,
there is no turning back.

37:04.505 --> 37:07.985
It'll consume your essence
and shorten your life.

37:08.985 --> 37:10.745
When the poison seeps into your bones,

37:11.345 --> 37:13.905
it will destroy you.

37:54.785 --> 37:55.985
He is inside.

38:11.705 --> 38:12.705
Your Majesty has suffered.

38:14.305 --> 38:15.505
I'm fine.

38:16.185 --> 38:18.545
You truly have not betrayed my trust.

38:21.345 --> 38:23.345
I've followed Your Majesty
for so many years.

38:24.225 --> 38:25.625
I never believed
you would harm Princess Ying,

38:27.585 --> 38:28.905
nor that you would seek your own death.

38:29.585 --> 38:31.985
So your leap from Phoenix Terrace
must have been your plan to escape.

38:33.065 --> 38:34.425
As soon as Eunuch Feng sent word,

38:34.505 --> 38:36.665
I immediately activated
the Xiaoxing secret guards

38:36.745 --> 38:37.945
and learned you were here.

38:46.505 --> 38:47.345
Commander Li,

38:47.425 --> 38:49.305
head to the meeting spot
outside the Capital now,

38:49.385 --> 38:50.545
activate the Xiaoxing secret guards,

38:51.145 --> 38:52.865
locate His Majesty, and await his command.

38:55.505 --> 38:56.385
Take care.

39:15.185 --> 39:16.985
How are things at court?

39:17.065 --> 39:18.465
Everything is just as you predicted.

39:18.545 --> 39:19.465
Although everyone believes

39:19.545 --> 39:21.745
you couldn't have survived
in the Qining River,

39:21.825 --> 39:24.825
the upright elder ministers
still invoked the ancestral rules

39:24.905 --> 39:26.345
to block the Prince of Yuzhang
from taking the throne.

39:26.425 --> 39:28.265
Even the Imperial Preceptor
can do nothing about it.

39:28.345 --> 39:29.425
So,

39:29.505 --> 39:32.705
they're focusing all their efforts
on searching for my body.

39:33.225 --> 39:34.425
Good.

39:34.505 --> 39:35.985
Next,

39:36.065 --> 39:38.625
I'll use my identity as the Ghost King
to lure the Saintess out.

39:38.705 --> 39:39.625
Your Majesty…

39:39.705 --> 39:42.145
Becoming the Ghost King
with the Moon-Eclipse

39:42.225 --> 39:44.265
is a choice I made long ago.

39:45.345 --> 39:46.585
You've given too much for Great Qi.

39:46.665 --> 39:50.345
I am answerable to the world
and to every subject of Great Qi.

39:50.945 --> 39:52.945
It's only Cangcang I've failed.

39:53.665 --> 39:54.825
How is Cangcang?

39:55.545 --> 39:57.025
The Empress is safe and sound.

39:58.825 --> 40:01.585
I never imagined that meeting Cangcang,

40:02.105 --> 40:04.705
killing Li Lu,
and obtaining the Moon-Eclipse

40:05.225 --> 40:08.185
were all fated from the start.

40:11.665 --> 40:12.545
Whatever you plan to do,

40:13.345 --> 40:14.825
I'll surely advance and retreat with you.

40:16.465 --> 40:17.465
Cangcang,

40:18.665 --> 40:20.585
her roots run deep in the palace.

40:21.105 --> 40:24.745
If I move against her,
it'll surely trigger a mad backlash.

40:25.785 --> 40:29.985
Only by getting you safely away
can I stake everything on one last move.

40:31.705 --> 40:32.865
I'm sorry.

40:32.945 --> 40:33.985
Bai!

41:09.545 --> 41:10.865
Are you there?

41:20.985 --> 41:23.785
Don't worry. I believe in you.

41:25.945 --> 41:27.625
I'll wait for you to come back.

41:47.145 --> 41:48.665
Thanks for looking after me, sir.

41:48.745 --> 41:50.545
I'll repay your kindness someday.

42:24.345 --> 42:25.305
Let's go.

42:28.745 --> 42:29.865
Are those wearing
ghost masks from Lingbi Sect?

42:30.505 --> 42:31.505
They are.

42:32.025 --> 42:34.345
I hear Lingbi Sect
is no small thing these days.

42:34.425 --> 42:37.065
They're recruiting men,
growing stronger and stronger.

42:37.585 --> 42:40.425
But hasn't Lingbi Sect been suppressed
by the court for over a year?

42:40.505 --> 42:42.745
And they still dare
to swagger around like this?

42:43.425 --> 42:46.505
Word is the Lingbi Saintess
has returned from the far south

42:46.585 --> 42:48.745
and even latched onto the court.

42:48.825 --> 42:50.425
Truly chaotic times.

42:51.065 --> 42:52.785
The court itself is a mess.

42:52.865 --> 42:54.425
The Emperor and Empress are both ill.

42:54.505 --> 42:55.825
A prince is acting as Regent.

42:57.065 --> 42:58.825
Could she be the Lingbi Saintess?

42:59.345 --> 43:00.425
Hush.

43:00.505 --> 43:02.225
Come on. Have some tea.

43:06.945 --> 43:09.305
My father planted spies in the palace.
How many are left?

43:09.825 --> 43:10.665
I don't know the exact number.

43:10.745 --> 43:14.185
Grand Tutor Ling laid many hidden pieces,
and even I don't know them all.

43:14.785 --> 43:15.905
Then how am I supposed to find them?

43:17.945 --> 43:19.105
-Me?
-Right.

43:19.185 --> 43:20.185
The key lies with you.

43:21.505 --> 43:22.345
What do you mean?

43:22.425 --> 43:24.945
Before Grand Tutor Ling
was killed at Fayun Temple,

43:25.465 --> 43:26.545
he secretly summoned us.

43:27.145 --> 43:28.425
If anything happened to him,

43:28.505 --> 43:30.065
Fayun Temple would sound
the bell as a warning,

43:30.145 --> 43:31.905
and we were all to follow your lead.

43:36.345 --> 43:37.945
All right. How do we meet them?

43:38.025 --> 43:40.225
Three days after the mourning period,
at Guisi Mausoleum.
